{#- Words and form fields copied from the live Contact page (11/25). No photo here (Mali, 11/25). Redesigned 11/25, reworked 11/26 (Mali: no all caps, no stack of small labels): intro with the Zoom call line, form on the right, one client quote on a dark card at the bottom of the left column. "How can I help?" choices match the goals on the Services page. Submissions go to Netlify Forms; email notifications get set up in Netlify before launch. -#}

<section class="contact-page">
  <div class="wrap contact-layout">
    <div class="contact-intro">
      <div class="eyebrow">Contact</div>
      <h1>Get In <em>Touch!</em></h1>
      <p class="lead">Tell me a little about your business and what you need, and I’ll get back to you.</p>
      <p class="ci-call">Rather talk it through? <a href="{{ site.consultUrl }}">Book a free 20-minute Zoom call</a></p>
    </div>

    <form class="contact-form" name="contact" method="POST" action="/contact/thank-you/" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="company">
      <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="contact">
      <p class="hp"><label>Leave this empty <input name="company"></label></p>
      <div class="cf-row">
        <label class="cf-field"><span>Name <i>(required)</i></span><input name="name" autocomplete="name" required></label>
        <label class="cf-field"><span>Email <i>(required)</i></span><input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required></label>
      </div>
      <fieldset class="cf-field">
        <legend>How can I help? <i>(required)</i></legend>
        <div class="chips">
          <label class="chip"><input type="radio" name="how-can-i-help" value="I need a new website" required><span>I need a new website</span></label>
          <label class="chip"><input type="radio" name="how-can-i-help" value="I want to update my website"><span>I want to update my website</span></label>
          <label class="chip"><input type="radio" name="how-can-i-help" value="I need more customers"><span>I need more customers</span></label>
          <label class="chip"><input type="radio" name="how-can-i-help" value="I want customers to come back"><span>I want customers to come back</span></label>
          <label class="chip"><input type="radio" name="how-can-i-help" value="I want to sell a course or products online"><span>I want to sell a course or products online</span></label>
          <label class="chip"><input type="radio" name="how-can-i-help" value="There has to be an easier way to do this"><span>There has to be an easier way to do this</span></label>
          <label class="chip"><input type="radio" name="how-can-i-help" value="I'm not sure what I need"><span>I’m not sure what I need</span></label>
        </div>
      </fieldset>
      <fieldset class="cf-field">
        <legend>How did you hear about me?</legend>
        <div class="chips">
          <label class="chip"><input type="radio" name="how-did-you-hear" value="Google"><span>Google</span></label>
          <label class="chip"><input type="radio" name="how-did-you-hear" value="99Designs"><span>99Designs</span></label>
          <label class="chip"><input type="radio" name="how-did-you-hear" value="Squarespace Marketplace"><span>Squarespace Marketplace</span></label>
          <label class="chip"><input type="radio" name="how-did-you-hear" value="Referral"><span>Referral</span></label>
          <label class="chip"><input type="radio" name="how-did-you-hear" value="Other"><span>Other</span></label>
        </div>
      </fieldset>
      <label class="cf-field"><span>Message <i>(required)</i></span><textarea name="message" rows="4" required></textarea></label>
      <button class="btn" type="submit">Send</button>
    </form>

    <aside class="contact-aside">
      <figure class="ca-quote">
        <p class="ca-meta"><span class="stars" role="img" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 2 3 6.6 7.2.8-5.4 4.9 1.5 7.1L12 17.8 5.7 21.4l1.5-7.1L1.8 9.4 9 8.6Z"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 2 3 6.6 7.2.8-5.4 4.9 1.5 7.1L12 17.8 5.7 21.4l1.5-7.1L1.8 9.4 9 8.6Z"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 2 3 6.6 7.2.8-5.4 4.9 1.5 7.1L12 17.8 5.7 21.4l1.5-7.1L1.8 9.4 9 8.6Z"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 2 3 6.6 7.2.8-5.4 4.9 1.5 7.1L12 17.8 5.7 21.4l1.5-7.1L1.8 9.4 9 8.6Z"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 2 3 6.6 7.2.8-5.4 4.9 1.5 7.1L12 17.8 5.7 21.4l1.5-7.1L1.8 9.4 9 8.6Z"/></svg></span><a href="https://99designs.com/profiles/clementinedesignstudio/about" target="_blank" rel="noopener">5.0 from 100+ reviews on 99designs<span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></p>
        <blockquote>“She truly understood my vision from the start.”</blockquote>
        <figcaption>I.E. · Custom website</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>
